    "body": "## Scope\n\nImplement synthetic, local-only trusted operator revocation and replacement of battle-scoped participant credentials, stacked directly on Draft PR #445 at `7cb5bc8a36f6c0c1ce36e88236a729be5ac9d036`.\n\nOnly these four files change:\n- `gameplay-server/migrations/0007_capability_operator_lifecycle.sql`\n- `gameplay-server/src/worker.js`\n- `gameplay-server/test/private_api_local_test.mjs`\n- `gameplay-server/test/test_chat03b2_capability_operator_lifecycle_sql.py`\n\n## Behavior\n\n- Adds admin-only `POST .../capabilities/{A|B}/revoke` and `/replace`; rejects requests with any Origin and rejects preflight.\n- Both operations compare the expected generation and advance it exactly once. Revoke keeps the old digest and disables it. Replace mints a fresh Worker-side random bearer, persists only its SHA-256 digest, and returns the bearer only after the atomic D1 update succeeds.\n- SQL transition guards reject status-only reactivation, identity reassignment, generation regression, and any reused historical credential digest. The digest history is append-only with no invented retention period.\n- Existing 0006 recovery-closure triggers remain in the same transaction as credential changes.\n- Worker comment and local integration test document lost-response recovery: do not retry; inspect the current generation via trusted D1 administration, then intentionally replace at that generation to invalidate the unknown credential.\n\n## Local validation\n\n- Wrangler/workerd/D1 private API integration with actual migrations 0001-0007: PASS (`CHAT03B2_LOCAL_PRIVATE_API_PASS (NOT PRODUCTION_AUTH_PASS)`).\n- Python gameplay-server suite: 61/61 PASS.\n- Offline hosted-D1 safety suite: 22/22 PASS.\n- Repository policy validator, Node syntax, and `git diff --check`: PASS.\n\nSynthetic/local-only. No hosted D1, deployment, production data, private-alpha policy approval, merge, or Safari acceptance is claimed. Please review this exact head independently.",
